{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>My sabbaths you shall keep</b> — juxtaposed to the 71 (labors). Sabbath is weighed against 71, and juxtaposed to it: <b>My sanctuary you shall revere</b> — building of the Holy Temple does not override Sabbath." "<b>My sabbaths you shall keep</b> — See that he wrote <b>keeping</b> after <b>Sabbath</b>: 'Keep the Sabbath day' — <b>keeping</b> after it. Yet <b>keeping</b> is also before it, for <b>keeping</b> is required both before it and after it — and this is addition of profane onto sacred."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:39.972637172Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}